    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels more than just needing a nap though. like i've tried resting and it doesn't help. it's like my soul is just spent. i feel like i'm just dragging this heavy body around and it's getting harder and harder to pretend that i'm actually \"in\" this life. does that make sense? like i'm just existing, but not really living.",
