      "content": "yeah it feels like that. just like i'm performing a role i didn't sign up for. it's just so much effort to keep it all going, every single day. sometimes i just think about what it would be like if everything just... stopped. if i didn't have to wake up and face the noise and the weight of it all anymore. like if i could just have permanent quiet. do you think that's a horrible way to feel?",
